# Studio site

- Cloudflare **Workers** static assets (`wrangler.jsonc` → `./site`), not Pages
- Logos: `site/assets/studio-mark.png` / `studio-icon.png` only
- Prefer existing `site/` CSS/JS patterns; no second site framework
